WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
A swordfish approaches a group of small fish. The overhead camera stays fixed.

00:03.800 --> 00:07.800
The head and rigid bill turn left, then right in a clear side-to-side sweep.

00:07.800 --> 00:10.400
The other fish scatter as the swordfish follows a slowed prey fish.

00:10.400 --> 00:11.500
Mouth capture is indicated schematically in this overhead view.

00:11.500 --> 00:14.000
The swordfish continues swimming. This is an illustrative AI reconstruction.
